# Boytel web client — local environment.
#
# Optional cross-origin API origin used by the typed API client
# (src/lib/api/clients.ts) and by the dev-server mock/proxy
# (scripts/dev/mock-api.mjs).
#
# - Unset (default): `bun run dev` serves a built-in mock API so the UI runs
#   standalone with demo data.
# - Set: `vite dev` proxies /api and /relays to this origin (point it at a
#   running boytel-backend dev server), and the typed client targets it
#   directly in production builds.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5174
